WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.575
Here's the fixture run, the
fictional tenant at ring 1.

2
00:00:03.575 --> 00:00:07.523
The preflight passes all five
test-stage checks: the right stage,

3
00:00:07.523 --> 00:00:12.438
a collection that matches its manifest
in the right tenant, the emergency group

4
00:00:12.438 --> 00:00:14.971
excluded from all five network policies,

5
00:00:14.971 --> 00:00:17.950
the diagnostic setting,
and approved decisions.

6
00:00:17.950 --> 00:00:21.560
Step 3 plans the rollback for
the state the ring starts from,

7
00:00:21.560 --> 00:00:26.570
before the ring starts: three enforced
policies to report-only in the guide's order,

8
00:00:26.570 --> 00:00:31.212
tagging off with the tenant restrictions
policy kept, then the manual steps.

9
00:00:31.212 --> 00:00:36.460
It's reviewed, its hash filed, and it's
applied only if a backout trigger fires.
